GOAL (apex ② owned-memory): wire the skill bank Store dispatch hand-off in core/src/skill_wire.rs so the parameterless `skill_store()` stub actually persists an extracted skill via the real `store_skill(&skill)` path.
CONTEXT: `store_skill(&skill)` already does a real rusqlite INSERT + self-provisions the 0008 schema + is FTS5-recallable. `skill_store()` returns SkillError::StoreFailed because run_skill_step(SkillStep::Store) does not thread the extracted Skill payload through. `extract_skill_from_candidate(...)` produces the Skill.
